<title>PERU: Peru's D'Onofrio Q3 net off 81 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's D'Onofrio Q3 net off 81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 108,550 soles vs 571,739 soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 114.75 million soles vs 123.89 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: D'Onofrio is an ice-cream and confectionery producer which forms part of Peru's  Grupo Gloria.</p>
<p>-- Renzo Pipoli, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
